	"notice": "Select CC mode for general MIDI control. DAW-specific modes use a separate protocol; do not assume those messages are ordinary CCs. SLIDER/KNOB is the performance endpoint; CTRL is for the editor. Physical controls and keys remain unbound because presets, modes and octave settings determine messages. Diagrams are selected-control schematics, not dimensioned panel drawings. Port names are recorded only when documented; otherwise detection uses an unambiguous complete model name or manual selection.",
